11:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-8 text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-[var(--text-primary)] [text-wrap:pretty]","children":"We keep personal data only as long as we need it, then delete or de-identify it. This policy sets the default periods for the main categories of data on NeoWork. For candidate data, the employer that ran the assessment (the controller) can set a shorter period within the limits below and can request deletion at any time. Some periods are floors or ceilings fixed by law and cannot be changed."}]
